VERDICT
======================================================================================================
  THE TWO-LOOP a0 PROTECTION TRANSFERS TO alpha=2 COMPLETELY, and on better footing than the
  one-loop transfer needed, because FOUR of the six legs never touch the kernel at all:

   (A) ADDITIVE -- CLOSED TO ALL ORDERS, KERNEL-FREE. The exact shift symmetry T -> T + const
       lives in the map T -> u = dT/|dT|, UPSTREAM of K. Verified symbolically with the full
       nonlinear square root: partial_c u_mu = 0 for all four components, and u is homogeneous
       of DEGREE 0 in dT. A mutation inserting an undifferentiated T correctly breaks it.
       beta_a0^additive = 0 exactly, for any alpha.

   TADPOLES (figure-8 + double-bubble) -- vanish on K(0) = 0 ALONE. Verified for alpha=2 BOTH
       ways Lane C required: closed form, and the FULL Herglotz measure integral
       1 - Int rho_2/s ds = 0 exactly. A 0.9x measure mutation re-opens the channel, so the
       leg's whole content really is K(0) = 0.

   (b1) SUM RULE -- an IDENTITY (K(inf) - K(0)), proven 2026-07-31; alpha=2's endpoints hold to
       1e-15, so both are protected individually as Lane C demanded.
   (b2) NO Box_u WAVEFUNCTION RENORMALIZATION -- KERNEL-FREE. Exact geodesy plus a
       non-dynamical 0-dof frame. I verified the underlying symbol claim myself: a purely
       timelike background frame makes u.grad = d/dtau, so Box_u^n is built from k0 ALONE for
       every n, spatially ultralocal, no kperp.
   (b3) COUNTERTERMS POLYNOMIAL IN W -- secured by mu <= 1 via K(z) = mu(sqrt z), i.e. by the
       PHENOMENOLOGY rather than by any assumption about the measure.

   GRAVITON -- KERNEL-FREE, and Lane C's residual on it is STALE. The all-n rationing proof
       contains ZERO references to the Herglotz measure, either density, the alpha=1 kernel
       form, or K(z) -- counted, not asserted. It is pure momentum-charge combinatorics on the
       Box_u^n string, proved AT EVERY RESOLVENT ORDER, and a Herglotz kernel is a positive
       superposition of exactly those resolvents. alpha=2's positive compact-support
       representation was derived 2026-07-31, so it inherits the result verbatim.

  *** CHRONOLOGY FINDING -- THE CORPUS IS UNDERSTATING ITS OWN POSITION. *** Lane C
  (2026-07-09) wrote 'graviton sector OPEN ... CAS-verified only to n=2'. Both
  twoloop_graviton_TTloop.py and twoloop_graviton_kperp_rationing_alln.py are dated
